E/ -- THE GROSS LAW FIRM ISSUES THE FOLLOWING NOTICE TO SHAREHOLDERS OF PAYPAL HOLDINGS, INC.. SHAREHOLDERS WHO PURCHASED SHARES OF PYPL DURING THE CLASS PERIOD LISTED ARE ENCOURAGED TO CONTACT THE FIRM REGARDING POSSIBLE LEAD PLAINTIFF APPOINTMENT.'}